WEBVTT

00:19.980 --> 00:23.300
♪Chasing wind, I set out afar♪

00:23.540 --> 00:26.780
♪The road ahead lost, my voice unheard♪

00:26.980 --> 00:28.900
♪I've tasted joy and sorrow♪

00:29.060 --> 00:32.420
♪Laying low, I plan every move♪

00:32.620 --> 00:35.940
♪With a mortal heart and lingering ties♪

00:36.140 --> 00:37.860
♪I'm roaming far and wide♪

00:38.220 --> 00:41.500
♪A twist of fate in desperate times♪

00:41.780 --> 00:45.020
♪A bond that outlives the dust of life♪

00:46.300 --> 00:49.700
♪Still chasing what immortality means♪

00:50.540 --> 00:55.140
♪Even eternity flashes by in a blink♪

00:58.980 --> 01:00.860
♪Don't mock my ordinary life♪

01:01.180 --> 01:04.860
♪I fight alone as chaos shakes the world♪

01:07.980 --> 01:09.900
♪Don't scorn my humble roots♪

01:10.140 --> 01:13.380
♪Kind at heart, ruthless when I must be♪

01:13.620 --> 01:15.540
♪Fate stirs with joy and grief beneath♪

01:15.780 --> 01:17.660
♪I hold the tide between life and death♪

01:18.100 --> 01:20.020
♪Faith carries me through endless dark♪

01:20.300 --> 01:22.180
♪And I return with a heart refined♪

01:26.020 --> 01:29.740
♪Forged by trial, I rise through three realms♪

01:29.740 --> 01:32.380
♪Reborn in the wheel of fate♪

01:32.380 --> 01:33.580
[The Immortal Ascension]

01:33.580 --> 01:34.780
[Adapted from the webnovel, The Immortal Ascension by Wangyu]

01:34.780 --> 01:35.980
[serialized in www.qidian.com under China Literature Limited]

01:36.060 --> 01:38.940
[Episode 3]

01:43.420 --> 01:46.020
[Longevity Art, Tier 5]

01:46.400 --> 01:47.460
He's back.

01:48.590 --> 01:49.650
And he brought someone with him.

02:09.790 --> 02:10.980
Who's the one in the mask?

02:13.960 --> 02:16.010
How's the cultivation coming along?

02:17.470 --> 02:18.410
You're asking too early.

02:18.840 --> 02:19.820
It's not time yet.

02:23.320 --> 02:25.180
The world is so vast,

02:25.560 --> 02:27.050
but no matter where I go,

02:27.560 --> 02:29.730
I always worry about you.

02:30.110 --> 02:32.330
Physician Mo's face is looking more and more lifeless.

02:39.390 --> 02:40.490
Show me your hand.

02:41.000 --> 02:42.050
Since you lied to me first,

02:42.870 --> 02:44.130
I see no reason to tell you the truth.

02:45.480 --> 02:46.740
The power of Tier 5

02:47.200 --> 02:49.460
is that it lets me control my internal qi.

02:50.430 --> 02:52.210
If I hold it at Tier 3,

02:52.870 --> 02:54.180
he won't notice my progress.

03:01.200 --> 03:03.850
I told you not to play tricks in front of me.

03:06.950 --> 03:08.290
So, how will you deal with me?

03:09.840 --> 03:10.540
Not bad.

03:10.640 --> 03:12.050
You're exactly who I want.

03:13.480 --> 03:15.410
Even now, you're keeping calm.

03:15.840 --> 03:17.900
But don't worry. You'll be fine.

03:18.310 --> 03:19.930
Your year's not up yet.

03:21.230 --> 03:23.130
But it's already been so long.

03:24.560 --> 03:25.620
Why is your cultivation

03:25.640 --> 03:27.460
still stuck at Tier 3?

03:29.560 --> 03:30.330
I did my best.

03:34.760 --> 03:35.850
Do you know

03:36.760 --> 03:39.180
what I gave you last time?

03:41.350 --> 03:42.770
Take this now.

03:48.520 --> 03:50.890
That pill is called Corpse Worm Pill.

03:51.750 --> 03:53.380
Actually, it's not really a pill.

03:54.520 --> 03:57.570
It's a worm egg crafted with a secret method.

03:58.960 --> 04:00.260
Once swallowed,

04:00.360 --> 04:02.450
it hides in your body.

04:02.800 --> 04:03.850
But don't worry.

04:05.030 --> 04:07.540
You'll be completely safe for now.

04:07.910 --> 04:09.060
As long as

04:09.910 --> 04:10.980
you take my antidote

04:12.870 --> 04:14.010
on time

04:14.150 --> 04:15.610
within a year,

04:16.360 --> 04:18.730
that egg will dissolve on its own

04:19.000 --> 04:20.940
without leaving any side effects.

04:21.470 --> 04:22.780
Otherwise...

04:27.310 --> 04:30.290
it'll absorb nutrients inside you,

04:30.840 --> 04:32.290
hatch,

04:32.870 --> 04:33.890
and then

04:33.910 --> 04:36.450
start eating every last one of your organs,

04:37.000 --> 04:39.170
until you die slowly

04:39.630 --> 04:41.500
in unspeakable pain.

04:45.000 --> 04:45.850
Besides,

04:46.470 --> 04:47.450
a few days ago,

04:48.000 --> 04:49.380
I went to Qingniu Town.

04:51.080 --> 04:52.850
From a distance, I saw your whole family

04:53.870 --> 04:55.100
doing just fine.

04:55.560 --> 04:56.690
Even munching on big flatbreads.

04:58.150 --> 04:59.850
And your little sister,

05:00.870 --> 05:02.100
she's grown into a lovely young lady.

05:02.750 --> 05:03.730
Quite the beauty.

05:03.840 --> 05:04.450
I swear!

05:05.710 --> 05:06.450
In three months,

05:07.560 --> 05:08.660
I'll reach Tier 4.

05:09.120 --> 05:09.890
Now...

05:10.590 --> 05:12.260
that's more like it!

05:19.520 --> 05:20.260
All right then.

05:20.520 --> 05:21.130
I'll stay right here

05:21.360 --> 05:22.290
for the next few months.

05:22.520 --> 05:23.690
I'm not going anywhere else.

05:27.870 --> 05:29.450
I went through hell

05:29.470 --> 05:30.870
to find these pills for you.

05:31.000 --> 05:32.570
It'll greatly help your cultivation.

05:36.240 --> 05:37.520
For the next three months,

05:37.680 --> 05:39.220
do whatever you like.

05:40.120 --> 05:42.260
Rest assured, I won't be watching you anymore.

05:43.400 --> 05:44.290
But...

05:45.400 --> 05:48.500
if you haven't made it by then,

05:51.030 --> 05:52.370
then it'll be

05:52.390 --> 05:55.410
the end for both of us.

06:07.160 --> 06:08.540
Only three months left.

06:09.720 --> 06:10.850
I've got to make the most of it.

06:30.190 --> 06:33.290
That brat even learned to make poison!

06:33.480 --> 06:35.220
I never taught him anything like that!

06:35.720 --> 06:36.930
This little punk

06:38.240 --> 06:40.020
is so ruthless.

06:40.360 --> 06:42.370
Ungrateful to the core.

06:44.950 --> 06:46.100
I've only just started cultivating.

06:46.680 --> 06:48.250
I can't rely on normal tactics

06:48.800 --> 06:50.050
to defeat someone like Physician Mo.

06:51.310 --> 06:52.610
Li Feiyu found me a manual

06:52.950 --> 06:54.460
called the Blink Sword Technique.

06:55.160 --> 06:56.410
He said it was perfect

06:56.510 --> 06:57.810
for someone like me with no foundation.

06:59.270 --> 07:00.730
But it's less of a sword technique

07:01.310 --> 07:03.020
and more like an assassination art.

07:03.950 --> 07:04.730
It's all

07:05.000 --> 07:06.290
about using your surroundings,

07:06.480 --> 07:07.250
setting traps,

07:07.800 --> 07:08.930
and manipulating light and shadows

07:09.310 --> 07:10.220
to mislead your enemy,

07:11.430 --> 07:12.050
so you can land

07:12.750 --> 07:13.980
a fatal strike.

08:04.340 --> 08:07.380
[Longevity Art, Tier 6]

08:17.870 --> 08:19.580
I've finally reached Tier 6.

08:20.800 --> 08:21.490
All my five senses

08:21.920 --> 08:23.050
have grown sharper.

08:24.390 --> 08:25.930
From the gurgle of distant streams

08:26.720 --> 08:27.540
to the flutter

08:27.830 --> 08:29.340
of nearby insect's wings,

08:30.310 --> 08:31.810
I can sense it all with perfect clarity.

08:59.750 --> 09:01.220
I give up!

09:02.270 --> 09:03.410
Teaching a disciple

09:03.920 --> 09:05.100
really is exhausting work!

09:05.800 --> 09:08.370
How do you get faster by the day?

09:08.870 --> 09:09.980
You're just a good master.

09:16.270 --> 09:17.140
Take this.

09:20.430 --> 09:22.050
It matches your Blink Sword Technique

09:22.600 --> 09:23.250
perfectly.

09:25.070 --> 09:25.700
Thanks.

09:31.600 --> 09:32.410
I'm heading back now.

09:35.240 --> 09:35.900
Han Li.

09:37.870 --> 09:38.610
I don't know

09:38.630 --> 09:40.140
what you've been through lately.

09:41.560 --> 09:42.930
But no matter what happens,

09:43.830 --> 09:45.140
don't face it alone.

09:46.160 --> 09:47.410
Send a message by pigeon if you must.

09:49.560 --> 09:50.290
Take care.

10:02.630 --> 10:03.980
Three months are up.

10:05.510 --> 10:06.170
Physician Mo,

10:07.390 --> 10:08.060
I'm coming for you.

10:21.510 --> 10:22.370
For this day,

10:23.200 --> 10:24.420
I've done all the prep I could.

10:25.670 --> 10:26.700
I'm not afraid anymore.

10:48.600 --> 10:50.370
Right on time, aren't you?

10:52.320 --> 10:52.890
Where's the antidote?

10:55.510 --> 10:57.130
Have you reached Tier 4?

10:57.320 --> 10:58.010
Where's the antidote?

11:06.150 --> 11:08.100
When people fight to survive,

11:08.960 --> 11:10.820
they always tap into

11:11.030 --> 11:13.420
unimaginable potential.

11:26.720 --> 11:27.530
Here. Take it.

11:39.630 --> 11:40.700
I have one more question.

11:43.080 --> 11:44.130
Speak up.

11:45.390 --> 11:46.060
Did Zhang Tie

11:48.440 --> 11:49.770
really go home?

11:54.240 --> 11:54.980
Of course.

11:58.750 --> 11:59.530
You're lying!

12:00.750 --> 12:01.770
I made a pact with him.

12:02.270 --> 12:03.130
If we didn't amount to anything,

12:03.670 --> 12:04.820
we'd never go home!

12:07.720 --> 12:08.580
See?

12:09.670 --> 12:11.850
You only half believe me.

12:13.240 --> 12:15.010
You act all cautious,

12:15.600 --> 12:17.420
but you're laughably naïve.

12:18.720 --> 12:21.100
You already knew the answer,

12:23.750 --> 12:25.130
so why even ask?

12:32.550 --> 12:33.770
You had me cultivated to Tier 4

12:34.790 --> 12:36.180
to help you detox and heal.

12:38.790 --> 12:39.890
That was a lie too, wasn't it?

12:45.550 --> 12:46.650
I'll tell you

12:48.790 --> 12:50.180
whatever you want to know.

12:54.390 --> 12:55.490
It's chilly out here.

12:57.670 --> 12:58.130
Come on,

12:59.150 --> 13:00.180
let's talk inside.

13:05.550 --> 13:06.180
Come on.

13:49.600 --> 13:51.130
The heavens are on my side.

13:54.720 --> 13:56.850
You really reached Tier 4!

13:59.550 --> 14:01.060
I'm not going to die!

14:01.750 --> 14:04.370
I'm only 37.

14:04.840 --> 14:07.700
I've barely started living!

14:10.790 --> 14:12.300
Strange, isn't it?

14:13.440 --> 14:15.770
I look so old at my 37.

14:16.150 --> 14:17.530
Anyone would think

14:17.550 --> 14:19.580
I'm pushing eighty and on death's door.

14:20.720 --> 14:22.940
If not for the strange poison in my body

14:22.960 --> 14:24.890
that I've struggled to keep down,

14:26.480 --> 14:29.130
why would I go through all this trouble?

14:32.840 --> 14:33.420
Come on.

14:34.480 --> 14:35.130
Han Li.

14:36.550 --> 14:38.730
Today marks the end

14:39.200 --> 14:40.700
of our master-disciple bond.

14:43.550 --> 14:45.300
Show me what you've got.

14:46.440 --> 14:47.460
Let me see

14:47.480 --> 14:48.770
what you've prepared.

15:49.390 --> 15:51.370
In less than three months,

15:56.240 --> 15:58.820
you've already made this much progress.

16:00.030 --> 16:03.010
You really keep surprising me.

16:09.390 --> 16:11.730
But my reputation

16:11.870 --> 16:13.820
wasn't built

16:14.030 --> 16:15.610
on medicine alone.

16:34.320 --> 16:36.180
Think you can take me on?

17:03.750 --> 17:06.460
[Silver Demon Palm]
My signature technique,

17:06.670 --> 17:08.300
the Silver Demon Palm,

17:13.670 --> 17:16.730
returns to the world today.

17:28.910 --> 17:31.340
Easy, my dear disciple.

17:33.440 --> 17:35.770
It'll all be over soon.

17:58.750 --> 18:00.650
You little brat!

18:01.030 --> 18:04.100
Hiding tricks up your sleeve, huh?

18:25.120 --> 18:26.700
You dared poison me?

18:26.790 --> 18:28.820
You've got some nerve!

18:57.960 --> 18:59.140
"Hide cleverness with clumsiness."

19:01.110 --> 19:02.050
You taught me that.

19:19.400 --> 19:20.420
Armored Puppet!

19:38.880 --> 19:40.700
"Hide cleverness with clumsiness."

19:41.480 --> 19:43.180
That's what I taught you.

19:53.440 --> 19:54.140
Armored Puppet.

20:45.480 --> 20:46.570
Stop struggling.

20:47.070 --> 20:48.940
He's a puppet I made myself.

20:49.240 --> 20:50.770
He only listens to me.

21:07.880 --> 21:09.220
Relax,

21:09.440 --> 21:10.250
Han Li.

21:11.160 --> 21:13.420
We were master and disciple, after all.

21:13.790 --> 21:15.700
I won't let you suffer too much.

21:16.160 --> 21:17.090
Did you

21:17.310 --> 21:18.730
do the same to Zhang Tie?

21:23.830 --> 21:25.090
Take a guess.

21:25.720 --> 21:27.460
He saw you as a second father,

21:27.550 --> 21:29.090
and you still harmed him?

21:29.640 --> 21:31.810
I had no choice.

21:33.720 --> 21:35.810
He didn't have a spirit root.

21:37.350 --> 21:38.380
And

21:38.590 --> 21:40.460
he couldn't practice the Longevity Art.

21:41.110 --> 21:43.010
So to me,

21:43.400 --> 21:45.420
he was useless.

21:48.640 --> 21:49.940
Mo Juren!

21:52.880 --> 21:54.010
Stop wasting time talking to him.

21:54.160 --> 21:55.380
Do it now!

21:55.510 --> 21:56.700
What's the rush?

21:59.030 --> 22:00.220
At this point,

22:01.200 --> 22:04.050
as long as your Seven Ghost Soul-Devouring Curse works,

22:05.680 --> 22:07.050
he's not going anywhere.

22:07.480 --> 22:08.530
Who are you talking to?

22:09.550 --> 22:10.570
Whose voice is that?

24:03.640 --> 24:05.220
Don't be afraid.

24:05.920 --> 24:07.660
Don't resist.

24:08.920 --> 24:10.660
Just enjoy

24:10.790 --> 24:14.490
this grand feast I've spent years preparing.

24:16.310 --> 24:17.570
I can hardly wait

24:17.720 --> 24:19.530
the thrill of rebirth.

24:24.110 --> 24:28.570
Seven Ghost Soul-Devouring Curse!

24:51.000 --> 24:51.660
Who are you?

24:58.440 --> 24:59.330
Take a look.

25:01.030 --> 25:02.860
This is what I used to look like.

25:12.750 --> 25:13.570
No need to be scared.

25:14.200 --> 25:16.090
It won't hurt that much!

25:16.880 --> 25:17.770
Relax.

25:18.200 --> 25:19.050
In just a moment,

25:19.350 --> 25:21.730
it'll all be over.

25:22.030 --> 25:23.380
Hurry, use the immobilizing talisman!

25:23.480 --> 25:24.980
Don't let him bite his tongue!

25:40.750 --> 25:42.290
Do it faster!

25:42.680 --> 25:44.290
All that you've achieved

25:45.110 --> 25:46.900
won't be in vain!

25:47.750 --> 25:48.940
Everything you are

25:49.440 --> 25:52.180
now belongs to us!

25:59.540 --> 26:02.980
[In Han Li's Consciousness Sea]

26:21.680 --> 26:22.900
Give me your body.

26:23.240 --> 26:25.420
Give it all to your master.

26:25.720 --> 26:27.220
Give it to me.

26:27.590 --> 26:28.460
Give it to me!

26:28.830 --> 26:29.530
Give it to me!

26:29.960 --> 26:30.770
Mine...

26:31.590 --> 26:32.420
It's mine!

26:32.510 --> 26:34.140
Give up everything you have,

26:34.160 --> 26:35.010
and hand it over!

26:35.350 --> 26:36.460
Hand it over!

26:36.510 --> 26:38.250
Give it all to your master!

26:38.550 --> 26:39.700
Hand it over!

26:40.070 --> 26:41.220
Hand it over!

26:41.750 --> 26:42.570
Hand it over!

26:42.590 --> 26:45.050
You're mine!

26:45.920 --> 26:46.570
You belong to me!

26:46.590 --> 26:47.380
Give it to me!

26:47.640 --> 26:49.380
- Give it to me! - Give it to me!

26:49.550 --> 26:50.460
Hand it over!

26:50.640 --> 26:51.380
Hand it over!

26:51.550 --> 26:52.620
- Give it to me!- Give it to me!

26:52.830 --> 26:53.420
Hand it over!

26:53.590 --> 26:54.010
No!

26:54.270 --> 26:55.620
This is my body!

26:55.680 --> 26:57.090
All of you, get out!

27:10.680 --> 27:11.770
How is he breaking free?

27:12.480 --> 27:13.980
Didn't you say I could possess him

27:14.750 --> 27:15.860
with your curse?

27:16.000 --> 27:17.380
The mantra I gave you

27:18.000 --> 27:20.050
only holds four tiers power.

27:20.790 --> 27:21.570
But he's

27:22.240 --> 27:24.140
also reached Tier 4.

27:24.400 --> 27:25.010
So basically,

27:25.960 --> 27:27.050
you wanted me and him

27:27.400 --> 27:28.530
to wear each other down,

27:28.720 --> 27:30.460
so you could swoop in and take over?

27:30.750 --> 27:32.180
What do you think?

27:34.030 --> 27:35.730
You sly little snake.

27:35.750 --> 27:37.570
I won't let you take him.

27:37.880 --> 27:39.220
He's my disciple!

27:39.550 --> 27:40.980
Enough talking.

27:41.550 --> 27:43.700
Let's settle this with skill!

28:18.550 --> 28:19.380
Tier 6?

28:19.960 --> 28:20.940
He tricked us.

28:21.110 --> 28:22.700
He's reached Tier 6!

28:28.440 --> 28:30.860
Oh, Han Li...

28:32.000 --> 28:33.770
Looks like...

28:35.510 --> 28:37.380
I really underestimated you.

28:38.000 --> 28:39.090
"Do good with discretion."

28:40.200 --> 28:41.330
That's what you taught me too.

28:41.880 --> 28:44.490
You truly are my worthy disciple.

28:46.310 --> 28:47.330
It's come to this.

28:49.640 --> 28:50.810
Got anything else to say?

28:56.350 --> 28:57.180
No.

29:08.550 --> 29:09.570
Nothing at all.

29:13.590 --> 29:14.700
That man just now

29:14.830 --> 29:15.700
is named Yu Zitong.

29:16.680 --> 29:17.860
Once you're out,

29:18.030 --> 29:19.860
don't believe a word he says.

29:20.440 --> 29:22.010
Kill him immediately.

29:22.640 --> 29:24.050
A primordial spirit's weakest point is poison.

29:25.440 --> 29:27.980
Use what you used on me.

29:29.070 --> 29:30.490
That's enough.

29:31.720 --> 29:32.490
Also,

29:33.200 --> 29:34.220
he fears the light.

29:45.070 --> 29:45.810
Goodbye,

29:47.590 --> 29:48.330
Master.

31:26.000 --> 31:26.460
And you?

31:28.000 --> 31:29.220
Got anything left to say?

31:30.030 --> 31:31.180
My name is Yu Zitong.

31:31.720 --> 31:33.090
I come from a cultivator clan.

31:36.270 --> 31:37.700
You're a cultivator,

31:39.000 --> 31:40.250
and well-connected.

31:41.350 --> 31:42.010
Got it.

31:43.160 --> 31:44.220
If you

31:44.920 --> 31:46.290
help me find another body

31:46.400 --> 31:47.330
so I can start over,

31:48.350 --> 31:49.490
I will, in return,

31:49.640 --> 31:50.860
recommend you to my clan!

31:52.030 --> 31:53.860
Don't believe a word he says.

31:54.510 --> 31:56.090
Kill him immediately.

31:56.640 --> 31:57.980
A soul's weakest point is poison.

31:59.510 --> 32:02.090
Use what you used on me.

32:04.110 --> 32:05.050
In the world of cultivation,

32:05.240 --> 32:06.490
everything becomes easier

32:06.590 --> 32:07.810
with a strong clan behind you!

32:08.640 --> 32:09.420
How does that sound?

32:12.000 --> 32:13.010
You said the same thing

32:14.270 --> 32:15.730
to Physician Mo, didn't you?

32:17.000 --> 32:18.380
That lowly mortal,

32:18.750 --> 32:20.700
how could he ever compare to us?

32:23.920 --> 32:24.660
Fair point.

32:25.590 --> 32:27.420
But he asked me to give you something.

32:36.350 --> 32:36.810
Get lost!

32:52.310 --> 32:52.980
Come out.

32:54.830 --> 32:55.420
Show yourself!

33:11.070 --> 33:11.770
Also,

33:13.440 --> 33:14.380
he fears the light.

33:17.750 --> 33:18.490
Let me out!

33:18.960 --> 33:19.700
What are you doing?

33:27.240 --> 33:28.090
Let me out!

33:28.830 --> 33:30.490
Let me out now!

33:36.680 --> 33:38.620
Whatever happened between you and Physician Mo,

33:39.480 --> 33:40.980
I couldn't care less.

33:41.960 --> 33:43.490
I just want to stay alive.

33:44.880 --> 33:45.810
I don't hurt others,

33:46.720 --> 33:48.330
and I won't let others hurt me!

34:18.030 --> 34:19.220
Without Physician Mo's command,

34:19.720 --> 34:20.490
this guy

34:20.880 --> 34:22.090
is totally still.

35:05.240 --> 35:05.860
This place

35:06.880 --> 35:08.180
should suit your tastes.

35:09.310 --> 35:10.460
No one will bother you here,

35:11.680 --> 35:12.860
because no one knows

35:13.640 --> 35:14.810
you're no longer alive.

35:17.510 --> 35:18.250
Master,

35:19.480 --> 35:20.330
just rest here,

35:21.440 --> 35:22.700
in peace.

35:38.350 --> 35:39.250
You old bastard,

35:39.880 --> 35:41.140
you won't let me go even in death.

35:54.840 --> 35:56.210
Disciple Han Li,

35:56.510 --> 35:58.300
if you're reading this letter,

35:58.590 --> 36:00.740
it means I've lost,

36:00.880 --> 36:02.210
and you've won.

36:02.800 --> 36:04.090
Congratulations.

36:05.480 --> 36:07.860
I only tried body possession out of desperation.

36:08.400 --> 36:09.380
It was fate.

36:09.480 --> 36:10.210
It was destiny.

36:10.670 --> 36:12.300
Now that I'm dead,

36:12.480 --> 36:15.050
there's no point talking about who's right or wrong.

36:15.230 --> 36:16.860
It'd just be laughable.

36:17.840 --> 36:20.490
As for the Silver Demon Palm poison in you,

36:21.480 --> 36:23.340
I've left you some antidote.

36:24.000 --> 36:25.690
It'll keep it suppressed for a few months.

36:28.400 --> 36:29.980
But to fully cure it,

36:30.670 --> 36:34.130
you'll need my family heirloom, the Sunwarm Jade.

36:35.110 --> 36:35.740
Han Li,

36:36.440 --> 36:39.340
I've never owed anyone an explanation.

36:39.960 --> 36:42.090
Victory or defeat, fate decides it all.

36:42.960 --> 36:44.860
But my wife and daughter

36:45.110 --> 36:46.530
have nothing to do with this.

36:47.550 --> 36:50.420
I trust you'll know what to do.

36:53.670 --> 36:55.210
You kept asking me

36:55.480 --> 36:57.210
what happened to Zhang Tie.

36:58.230 --> 36:59.650
Sadly, in this world,

37:00.150 --> 37:01.940
there's no Zhang Tie left.

37:03.030 --> 37:04.860
I never meant to kill him,

37:05.400 --> 37:07.530
but he uncovered my secret.

37:07.840 --> 37:08.980
So I had no choice

37:09.070 --> 37:11.260
but to use his body to forge

37:11.710 --> 37:13.780
a soulless, mindless puppet.

37:14.590 --> 37:16.460
I named him Armored Puppet.

37:23.000 --> 37:25.650
That puppet's mind was completely wiped.

37:26.190 --> 37:27.130
It moves at the sound of a bell.

37:27.960 --> 37:29.490
Bind it with your blood,

37:30.000 --> 37:31.780
and it obeys your will.

37:33.740 --> 37:38.180
♪In dreams, the fragments of dreams remain♪

37:39.940 --> 37:44.300
♪A slanting moon falls into heaven's mirrored lake♪

37:46.500 --> 37:48.700
♪Time slips by, yet my steps still linger♪

37:49.500 --> 37:51.540
♪The scenery returns, faint and tender♪

37:52.580 --> 37:58.660
♪Unforgettable, easier to remember than to let go♪

38:00.660 --> 38:05.060
♪We say the past is smoke and haze...♪

38:06.480 --> 38:07.420
Blockhead, time to go!

38:10.670 --> 38:11.300
Tie.

38:11.630 --> 38:12.300
I've got pancakes too!

38:12.670 --> 38:14.650
My father made these for me after borrowing three bowls of flour from Uncle Niu.

38:16.110 --> 38:16.690
Blockhead,

38:17.160 --> 38:18.170
why don't you wear it?

38:18.320 --> 38:19.170
It looks better on you.

38:19.320 --> 38:20.260
You can alternate between the two.

38:20.260 --> 38:25.420
♪Eyes veiled in dust, times have changed...♪

38:28.880 --> 38:30.050
All souls in this world

38:30.960 --> 38:31.940
eventually end like a song.

38:34.030 --> 38:35.050
From now on,

38:38.000 --> 38:38.900
you'll be called Qu Hun.

38:39.300 --> 38:44.260
♪Looking back, I'm on the mountaintop. Time forgotten, memory won't stop♪

38:45.700 --> 38:51.820
♪Was it yesterday? Or was it tomorrow?♪

38:52.900 --> 38:57.980
♪As oceans shift and lands replace, nothing will remain the same♪

38:58.820 --> 39:01.340
♪Even times will change, time will wear down♪

39:01.940 --> 39:04.220
♪The words that have been spoken♪

39:06.020 --> 39:08.700
♪Only this longing♪

39:09.620 --> 39:14.700
♪Will cross centuries♪

39:16.420 --> 39:22.580
♪And last eternally♪

39:28.000 --> 39:29.490
Physician Mo left behind tons of secret texts.

39:30.280 --> 39:31.300
The world outside is dangerous.

39:32.030 --> 39:33.610
I need to learn a few more skills

39:34.000 --> 39:35.210
before I leave here.

39:35.210 --> 39:38.180
[Medical Recipes and Herb Manuals]

39:44.300 --> 39:45.260
[Longevity Art]

39:45.280 --> 39:46.260
Longevity Art...

39:47.590 --> 39:49.490
So that's what I've practiced.

39:52.230 --> 39:53.210
Why is there only half of it?

40:03.000 --> 40:03.900
Moving objects from a distance,

40:04.400 --> 40:05.490
is called the Object Control Spell.

40:06.880 --> 40:07.780
Heaven's Eye Spell

40:08.110 --> 40:09.940
is a spell that reveals

40:10.230 --> 40:11.940
the depth of one's cultivation power.

40:13.840 --> 40:14.900
Back then,

40:15.190 --> 40:16.340
Yu Zitong must've used this spell

40:17.000 --> 40:17.960
to instantly recognize

40:17.960 --> 40:18.940
that I had reached Tier 6.

40:20.110 --> 40:20.860
But among them all,

40:21.230 --> 40:22.320
the hardest spell to master

40:23.030 --> 40:24.210
has to be Fireball Technique.

40:25.320 --> 40:25.860
If used right,

40:26.280 --> 40:27.380
this one spell

40:28.320 --> 40:29.780
can be devastatingly powerful.

41:57.670 --> 41:59.130
Eighty-one strikes of the alarm bell.

42:00.440 --> 42:02.210
The Wild Wolves Gang actually made it here?

42:02.840 --> 42:04.300
Qu Hun, run!

42:20.420 --> 42:22.700
[Jia Tianlong, Leader of the Wild Wolves Gang]

42:23.110 --> 42:25.170
You've kept us down for years.

42:25.590 --> 42:27.420
Today, I'm here to settle the score!

42:30.580 --> 42:32.220
[Wang Juechu, Leader of the Seven Mysteries Sect]

42:43.510 --> 42:44.570
Kill!

42:44.840 --> 42:45.610
Kill them all!

43:13.000 --> 43:13.740
Master Wang,

43:14.070 --> 43:15.340
do you really want mutual destruction?

43:15.670 --> 43:16.530
Master Jia,

43:18.320 --> 43:19.780
I won't let the Seven Mysteries Sect

43:19.800 --> 43:21.420
be destroyed in front of my eyes.

43:21.800 --> 43:22.980
If I trigger the mechanism,

43:23.590 --> 43:24.980
the mountain will crumble!

43:28.190 --> 43:30.010
If you don't want us both dead,

43:31.360 --> 43:32.900
maybe hear me out first.

43:35.110 --> 43:35.980
Master Wang,

43:37.400 --> 43:38.570
what do you have in mind?

43:39.320 --> 43:40.380
Stop the mechanism, and we'll talk!

43:52.440 --> 43:52.820
Qu Hun,

43:53.000 --> 43:53.460
hurry!

44:04.590 --> 44:05.300
Wait!

44:06.030 --> 44:06.530
Back off.

44:15.920 --> 44:16.420
Han Li!

44:17.360 --> 44:18.130
My good buddy!

44:19.000 --> 44:20.490
I knew you'd show up in need.

44:20.800 --> 44:21.650
They've already broken through.

44:22.110 --> 44:22.980
Go, protect the master with me!

44:23.980 --> 44:25.820
[Blood Duel Pact]

44:29.760 --> 44:30.260
I,

44:30.760 --> 44:32.030
Sect Master Wang Juechu,

44:32.230 --> 44:33.570
hereby agree with Jia Tianlong

44:34.110 --> 44:35.860
to settle this by a blood duel.

44:36.880 --> 44:37.690
Ten men each.

44:38.960 --> 44:40.210
Fight to the death.

44:41.110 --> 44:42.490
Li Zhanling of the Seven Mysteries Sect!

44:42.550 --> 44:43.690
Liu Chong of the Seven Mysteries Sect!

44:46.070 --> 44:47.130
Count me in!

44:51.280 --> 44:52.690
Li Feiyu of Outer Blade Hall is here!

44:53.670 --> 44:55.170
Who's got the guts to fight me to the death?

44:56.000 --> 44:57.380
I really didn't want to get involved,

44:58.110 --> 45:00.090
but I can't just watch him walk into death.

45:03.840 --> 45:04.860
I won't sign the pact,

45:05.590 --> 45:06.050
but I'll fight

45:06.590 --> 45:07.090
right alongside you.

45:08.550 --> 45:09.380
You're a physician.

45:10.280 --> 45:10.860
Why are you even in this fight?

45:10.880 --> 45:11.560
Step back!

45:11.800 --> 45:12.780
All of you, stand down!

45:13.030 --> 45:13.530
I'll handle this!

45:14.920 --> 45:15.570
Mentor Lu is here!

45:15.840 --> 45:16.760
We're going to crush them!

45:16.880 --> 45:17.490
Mentor Lu,

45:17.490 --> 45:18.130
kill them!

45:32.980 --> 45:34.500
[Master Jinguang]

45:35.190 --> 45:35.820
Jia Tianlong,

45:36.550 --> 45:38.130
are you trying to make a fool of me?

45:43.590 --> 45:44.940
Even a lion goes full force

45:45.190 --> 45:46.380
when it's fighting a rabbit.

45:47.760 --> 45:48.820
Forgive the offense!

45:57.380 --> 45:57.940
[Heaven's Eye Spell]

45:57.960 --> 45:58.740
He's a cultivator?

46:05.110 --> 46:06.300
His tier's even lower than mine.

46:06.440 --> 46:07.980
We have a true cultivator on our side.

46:09.110 --> 46:10.490
Didn't expect that, huh?

46:27.070 --> 46:27.690
Mentor!

46:27.960 --> 46:28.820
Nice!

46:29.230 --> 46:30.740
Very nice!

46:30.840 --> 46:31.530
You demon freak!

46:32.110 --> 46:33.130
How dare you act so wildly!

46:39.630 --> 46:40.310
You worthless insect.

46:40.320 --> 46:41.360
You've got a death wish!

46:58.800 --> 47:00.090
Know your place!

47:01.860 --> 47:03.380
None of you are walking out alive today!

47:15.050 --> 47:16.420
Why won't this thing obey me?

47:26.280 --> 47:27.570
A cultivator!

47:38.150 --> 47:39.090
Han Li...

47:40.760 --> 47:41.530
Leave it to me.

47:45.280 --> 47:46.050
Senior Li.

47:59.190 --> 48:00.010
This thing isn't bad.

48:00.550 --> 48:01.210
I'll take it.

48:01.920 --> 48:02.340
Hey, you!

48:03.000 --> 48:04.010
Which family are you from?

48:07.150 --> 48:08.170
Which family do you belong to?

48:09.510 --> 48:10.940
I'm from the Ye family of Qinling,

48:11.320 --> 48:12.170
just passing through

48:12.230 --> 48:13.380
on my way to Tainan Valley.

48:13.480 --> 48:14.490
I don't want any trouble.

48:14.800 --> 48:15.690
Since you're here,

48:16.110 --> 48:17.340
I'll back off.

48:17.960 --> 48:19.010
What nonsense is this?

48:19.840 --> 48:20.820
The Ye family from Qinling?

48:22.710 --> 48:23.610
I've heard of them.

48:25.840 --> 48:26.900
So why did you interfere?

48:28.110 --> 48:28.860
I...

48:29.190 --> 48:30.570
I just took his offering.

48:30.710 --> 48:31.420
So I made an exception.

48:31.510 --> 48:32.530
I didn't mean to offend you!

48:34.110 --> 48:34.570
An exception, huh?

48:35.510 --> 48:37.460
As cultivators, we really shouldn't meddle

48:37.590 --> 48:38.690
in mortal affairs.

48:39.710 --> 48:40.170
But...

48:40.400 --> 48:41.860
I had no choice.

48:44.710 --> 48:45.570
Since you've admitted your mistake,

48:46.480 --> 48:47.210
take back

48:48.230 --> 48:48.780
your flying sword talisman.

48:50.230 --> 48:51.570
Then I'll accept your kindness.

48:51.710 --> 48:53.260
And you might want to stay away

48:53.280 --> 48:53.980
from these mortal insects,

48:54.150 --> 48:55.460
or you'll end up tainted too.

49:05.110 --> 49:08.090
- Great! - Great!

49:23.510 --> 49:24.340
What kind of treasure is this?

49:25.150 --> 49:26.610
Even the Fireball Technique can't burn it.

49:26.610 --> 49:27.700
[Command Seal]

49:30.440 --> 49:32.070
- Great! - Great!

49:32.320 --> 49:33.130
Master Jia.

49:33.880 --> 49:34.690
Where are you heading?

49:36.590 --> 49:37.420
Master,

49:37.840 --> 49:38.740
let's talk this through.

49:39.670 --> 49:41.530
I've got no quarrel with you.

49:41.840 --> 49:42.940
If you'd just spare me,

49:43.280 --> 49:43.940
I'd gladly

49:44.280 --> 49:45.590
reward you handsomely!

49:51.190 --> 49:52.530
You've killed countless innocents.

49:53.400 --> 49:54.650
Ever think this day would come?

49:57.280 --> 49:58.340
I might spare the others,

49:59.000 --> 49:59.650
but you...

50:00.920 --> 50:02.610
You're the one I'll never forgive.

50:05.320 --> 50:06.380
Will you take your own life

50:07.760 --> 50:08.610
or shall I do it for you?

50:11.670 --> 50:12.740
Everyone of the Wild Wolves Gang!

50:13.030 --> 50:13.940
Kill!

50:17.760 --> 50:18.490
Kill him!

50:19.230 --> 50:19.780
Charge!

50:20.150 --> 50:21.050
Kill him!

50:24.360 --> 50:26.170
I'm dead either way...

50:29.710 --> 50:30.740
Master!

50:45.320 --> 50:47.380
Master, you saved the sect today.

50:47.840 --> 50:49.050
I owe you a great debt.

50:49.800 --> 50:51.530
How would you like to be repaid?

50:55.920 --> 50:57.340
I'll give you the position of Deputy Sect Master,

50:57.920 --> 50:58.980
one thousand taels of silver.

50:59.550 --> 51:01.820
And all elders and disciples will obey your orders.

51:02.800 --> 51:03.260
But,

51:03.480 --> 51:04.820
only after I pass away,

51:05.550 --> 51:06.210
the sect

51:06.440 --> 51:07.300
will finally be yours.

51:08.150 --> 51:08.780
What do you say?

51:16.400 --> 51:18.260
Why don't you first call off the ambush

51:19.280 --> 51:19.900
hiding out?

51:37.030 --> 51:38.210
They were probably

51:38.510 --> 51:39.690
put there by Elder Zhang.

51:42.030 --> 51:42.650
Master,

51:43.760 --> 51:45.860
I meant no disrespect.

51:46.510 --> 51:47.340
As sect leader,

51:47.440 --> 51:48.900
there are things I simply can't control.

51:49.510 --> 51:50.820
When you found

51:51.000 --> 51:51.820
your own sect,

51:52.190 --> 51:53.090
you'll understand.

51:55.920 --> 51:56.940
Don't worry, Master Wang.

51:57.440 --> 51:58.170
I won't

51:58.590 --> 51:59.460
be staying for long.

52:00.480 --> 52:01.940
After today,

52:02.800 --> 52:04.260
I'll be gone for good.

52:05.070 --> 52:06.170
But before I go,

52:07.070 --> 52:07.940
there's a deal

52:08.320 --> 52:09.010
I'd like to strike,

52:09.320 --> 52:10.860
one that benefits both of us.

52:12.080 --> 52:13.670
Of course. No problem.

52:18.320 --> 52:19.940
You haven't even heard my terms yet.

52:22.030 --> 52:22.940
Please, go ahead.

52:25.590 --> 52:26.980
Take Li Feiyu as your final disciple.

52:27.440 --> 52:27.860
Besides,

52:28.960 --> 52:30.840
appoint him as head of the Outer Blade Hall.

52:33.960 --> 52:34.380
Done.

52:35.230 --> 52:36.050
Anything else?

52:37.920 --> 52:40.420
He's in love with Elder Zhang's third daughter, Zhang Xiu'er.

52:41.550 --> 52:43.170
But Elder Zhang disapproves because he's poor.

52:43.960 --> 52:44.570
I'll talk to him.

52:44.670 --> 52:45.420
It's not a big deal.

52:45.880 --> 52:46.570
Anything else?

52:49.440 --> 52:50.170
I have a third uncle.

52:50.880 --> 52:51.900
He's just an outer disciple.

52:53.000 --> 52:53.530
He was the one

52:54.110 --> 52:55.570
who brought me to the Seven Mysteries Sect.

52:55.960 --> 52:57.010
If something happens to him later,

52:57.710 --> 52:59.300
- I hope you'll take care of him. - Of course.

52:59.710 --> 53:00.260
No problem at all.

53:04.280 --> 53:04.940
As for me,

53:05.230 --> 53:06.610
I won't let you go unrewarded.

53:08.960 --> 53:09.530
This one

53:10.000 --> 53:11.740
is a rare treasure, the Essence Pill.

53:12.070 --> 53:12.780
Keep it.

53:13.110 --> 53:14.170
It might just save your life

53:14.840 --> 53:15.490
in a critical moment.

53:20.440 --> 53:21.770
I got everything you've said.

53:22.330 --> 53:24.360
I accept it all.

53:25.670 --> 53:26.340
Farewell.

53:31.820 --> 53:34.860
♪That day I first saw you♪

53:35.420 --> 53:38.460
♪We held close, hearts full of joy♪

53:40.180 --> 53:43.220
♪We made a promise to reunite♪

53:44.180 --> 53:47.300
♪And walked into the unknown♪

53:48.660 --> 53:51.620
♪But now that we've met again...♪

53:53.760 --> 53:55.780
I've always been a loner.

53:56.030 --> 53:57.420
Never thought I'd find

53:57.480 --> 53:59.210
a true friend like you.

53:59.590 --> 54:00.820
I may not be good at much,

54:01.030 --> 54:03.010
but I've never feared a fight!

54:04.320 --> 54:05.740
Since we're brothers now,

54:07.190 --> 54:08.210
if anyone ever dares

54:08.510 --> 54:09.820
to mess with you,

54:11.550 --> 54:13.130
just give them my name,

54:14.070 --> 54:14.860
Li Feiyu!

54:15.280 --> 54:16.090
Someday,

54:16.280 --> 54:18.490
- my name will echo across the Tiannan Continent! - Deal!

54:18.840 --> 54:20.860
Li Feiyu!

54:21.630 --> 54:24.010
Li Feiyu!

54:26.260 --> 54:29.860
♪There's still hardship ahead♪

54:30.460 --> 54:33.060
♪Even as cold winds blow...♪

54:33.070 --> 54:35.340
Farewell, Master Han!

54:38.220 --> 54:41.780
♪We're just fleeting mortals♪

54:42.460 --> 54:45.980
♪Time slipped by before we knew♪

54:46.420 --> 54:50.020
♪Yet we burn that spark of light♪

54:50.620 --> 54:54.100
♪Into this starry sky♪

54:54.820 --> 54:58.220
♪Starlight fades into the Milky Way♪

54:58.780 --> 55:02.340
♪While the mayfly dies in the whirlpool...♪

55:04.630 --> 55:06.170
This time, I really am leaving.

55:07.800 --> 55:08.340
Han Li!

55:10.800 --> 55:13.650
I caught a fish!

55:14.400 --> 55:15.490
What a big one!

55:15.800 --> 55:16.340
Come on!

55:16.440 --> 55:17.130
Let's get a fire going!

55:19.580 --> 55:23.020
♪But my heart has never rested♪

55:23.540 --> 55:27.100
♪Ever chasing, still searching on♪

55:27.660 --> 55:31.180
♪Through all the joy and sorrow♪

55:31.940 --> 55:35.340
♪How do I choose the way?♪

55:35.900 --> 55:39.420
♪Now we part, so far apart...♪

55:41.230 --> 55:42.130
Six years have passed.

55:43.000 --> 55:43.980
Everything's changed.

55:44.840 --> 55:45.610
No one's left.

55:48.880 --> 55:51.130
Remember what I told you.

55:55.190 --> 55:56.940
Staying alive is what matters most.

55:57.480 --> 55:59.210
If you can't win,

56:00.030 --> 56:02.130
just run.

56:02.710 --> 56:03.690
Got that?

56:06.480 --> 56:09.780
Don't forget you started as a mortal.

56:11.590 --> 56:13.130
Even if you become immortal,

56:14.760 --> 56:17.210
act like a human being.

56:21.590 --> 56:23.210
Just imagine how you'll mess

56:23.230 --> 56:25.260
with those cocky immortals,

56:27.230 --> 56:28.300
I can't help

56:28.550 --> 56:29.860
but laugh out loud.

56:33.280 --> 56:33.980
Sure.

56:34.880 --> 56:36.380
Just rest in peace.

56:36.420 --> 56:39.580
♪The ones before once told me♪

56:40.060 --> 56:43.620
♪There's still hardship ahead♪

56:44.220 --> 56:47.780
♪Even as cold winds blow...♪

56:47.800 --> 56:51.300
Why should only immortals soar through the skies,

56:52.190 --> 56:53.050
while we mortals

56:53.190 --> 56:54.940
stay trapped like frogs in a well?

56:56.880 --> 56:57.570
Han Li,

56:58.150 --> 57:00.420
there's so much beauty in this world.

57:02.630 --> 57:04.170
Go see it

57:04.440 --> 57:05.980
in my place.

57:08.380 --> 57:11.980
♪Starlight fades into the Milky Way...♪

57:14.710 --> 57:15.530
Goodbye,

57:16.280 --> 57:17.010
Physician Mo,

57:17.880 --> 57:18.530
Zhang Tie,

57:19.920 --> 57:20.820
and Shenshou Valley.

57:20.860 --> 57:24.380
♪Playing the fleeting game of life♪

57:24.900 --> 57:28.460
♪Each step of fate's game unclear♪

57:29.140 --> 57:32.660
♪Who can guess the ending?♪

57:33.180 --> 57:36.740
♪But my heart has never rested♪

57:37.380 --> 57:40.780
♪Ever chasing, still searching on♪

57:41.620 --> 57:44.860
♪Through all the joy and sorrow♪

57:45.780 --> 57:49.020
♪How do I choose the way...♪

57:50.960 --> 57:51.460
I'm off.

57:52.670 --> 57:53.900
The pills I left you

57:54.320 --> 57:55.050
are enough to last ten years.

57:55.960 --> 57:57.050
Even without the Bone Agony Pill,

57:57.050 --> 57:57.920
[For Li]

57:57.920 --> 57:58.940
you'll become a great hero.

58:00.550 --> 58:01.300
Don't worry about me.

58:01.880 --> 58:02.380
Take care of yourself too.

58:03.920 --> 58:05.090
I believe the day will come

58:05.800 --> 58:06.460
when your name

58:07.230 --> 58:08.650
echoes across the Tiannan Continent.

58:10.070 --> 58:11.090
Han Li!

58:12.360 --> 58:13.570
Han Li, remember this:

58:14.280 --> 58:15.210
Before the name Li Feiyu

58:15.230 --> 58:16.940
shakes the Tiannan Continent,

58:18.110 --> 58:19.050
I won't die.

58:19.550 --> 58:20.740
And you're not allowed to die either.

58:47.420 --> 58:52.740
♪Shards of dreams inside a dream♪

58:53.980 --> 58:59.380
♪A pale moon falls into mirrored skies♪

58:59.500 --> 59:02.700
♪Years slipped by as I lingered on♪

59:02.940 --> 59:05.180
♪Old scenes rise again♪

59:05.580 --> 59:08.420
♪Too hard to forget♪

59:08.940 --> 59:12.900
♪Easier just to miss♪

59:13.740 --> 59:19.220
♪They say the past fades like smoke♪

59:20.380 --> 59:25.660
♪But looking back still stirs the ache♪

59:26.260 --> 59:29.300
♪This noisy world, this lonely page♪

59:29.580 --> 59:31.700
♪Swept away by time♪

59:32.340 --> 59:34.980
♪Eyes once looked far♪

59:35.460 --> 59:39.420
♪Now lost in the shift♪

59:39.900 --> 59:42.740
♪Autumn winds stir♪

59:43.020 --> 59:44.940
♪Smoke curls once more♪

59:45.380 --> 59:47.820
♪Like clouds on the edge of sky♪

59:48.140 --> 59:51.660
♪Returning to my eyes♪

59:52.220 --> 59:55.180
♪Looking back from the mountaintop♪

59:55.500 --> 59:58.420
♪Time lost its name♪

59:58.820 --> 01:00:01.660
♪Was it yesterday♪

01:00:02.060 --> 01:00:05.620
♪Or tomorrow?♪

01:00:05.980 --> 01:00:08.820
♪The world has changed♪

01:00:09.220 --> 01:00:11.060
♪Beyond recall♪

01:00:11.620 --> 01:00:13.340
♪Time will fade♪

01:00:13.740 --> 01:00:18.540
♪All the words ever spoken♪

01:00:19.220 --> 01:00:22.100
♪Only this longing remains♪

01:00:22.580 --> 01:00:27.860
♪Crossing centuries and days♪

01:00:28.980 --> 01:00:35.620
♪In a fleeting moment we call eternity♪

01:00:36.100 --> 01:00:45.820
♪In a fleeting moment called eternity♪
